80: /**
81:  * Represents a snapshot of the process tree of the current system.
82:  *
83:  * <p>
84:  * A {@link ProcessTree} is really conceptually a map from process ID to a {@link OSProcess} object.
85:  * When Hudson runs on platforms that support process introspection, this allows you to introspect
86:  * and do some useful things on processes. On other platforms, the implementation falls back to
87:  * "do nothing" behavior.
